eval-log/coverage/scripts/plugins-dev-graph-scripts-gh-bridge.py.json:8:    "notes": "genuine code-review + py_compile OK / frontmatter 正直 (network:true, write-scope: approved gh CLI mutations only)。gh Issue/Projects v2/lifecycle への決定的 dry-run-safe ブリッジ。MUTATIONS 集合を --dry-run で preview 抑止 (mutation_suppressed:true)。normalize_issue は id/number/url 欠落を fail-closed。lifecycle-facts は defaultBranchRef+PR(state/merged/mergedAt/base/head/mergeCommit/closingIssuesReferences) を単一 GraphQL snapshot で取得し、defaultBranchRef/pullRequest/closing の型を逐一検証。project-resolve は user XOR organization の projectV2 が正確に 1 件であること・field alias 一意性を強制。retry_classification で safe_read/verify_before_retry/idempotent を明示 (再試行安全性の契約化)。DEV_GRAPH_GH env override でテスト注入可。SMELL: project-item-find の page[\\\"data\\\"][\\\"node\\\"][\\\"items\\\"] は gh GraphQL 応答形状を直接添字参照しており、error 応答等で data.node が無い場合 KeyError/TypeError が main の except ContractError を素通りして traceback exit になりうる (lifecycle-facts 経路は .get で防御済みだが project 系は防御が薄い)。実運用の reconcile 主経路は lifecycle-facts のみ使用のため影響限定。TESTS: test_runtime_coverage.py::test_gh_bridge_helpers_and_operations、test_semantic_c25_c28.py / c26。"
eval-log/coverage/scripts/plugins-dev-graph-scripts-reconcile-github-lifecycle.py.json:8:    "notes": "genuine code-review + py_compile OK / frontmatter 完備 (network:true, write-scope: git-common-dir completion request/transaction/event ledgers only; graph/Markdown writes belong to C02, dependencies:[gh-bridge.py, manage-worktree-lease.py, bd-bridge.py])。C12 検証済み default-branch PR fact を C02 consumer 経由で冪等 completion + C27 release + beads close へ収束。remote fact は gh-bridge(C12 ACL) 経由のみ、DEV_GRAPH_GH_FIXTURE テストフック有。c24_context が coordination root 一致を検証。completion decision は merged∧base==default∧branch==default∧clean∧synced_default∧merge_commit が HEAD の ancestor∧linkage(marker exact-unique + closing reference) の全 AND (fail-closed で conflicts 列挙)。completion-receipts/<digest>.json の二相トランザクション台帳に steps(c02_writer/completion_event/system_release/beads_close)を刻み writer_request を pin、status=complete なら冪等 replay。_writer_applied が C02 receipt の request_digest/graph_revision(+1)/graph_sha256/durable node+Markdown parity を厳格照合し偽装受領を拒否。feature_rollup は exact-13 + P07/P10/P11 の PASS evidence receipt(covered_task_ids/phase_ref/feature_acceptance 一致) を検証。system-release/beads 失敗は pending_retry + exit1 で安全再開。SMELL: main が ~220 行で巨大・分岐膨大 (監査負荷) だが各段は atomic_json で逐次 durable、各失敗経路が pending_retry へ縮退し中途破壊を回避。TESTS: test_c25_lifecycle_hook_contract.py、test_runtime_coverage.py::test_reconcile_lifecycle_modes、test_semantic_c25_c28 / c26。"
